 every movement of the snake brings tranquility and relaxation. Enjoy the soothing atmosphere and stunning graphics that bring the ocean depths to life.\nTrain your brain while playing: \"Snake Room\" is designed not just for entertainment but also to improve your spatial awareness and decision-making abilities. The game offers unique challenges that will help develop your attention and cognitive skills.\nIntuitive control for everyone: Regardless of your VR experience, \"Snake Room\" provides ease and intuitiveness in control. This makes the game accessible and enjoyable for players of all levels.\nPrepare for a new dimension of entertainment in virtual reality with \"Snake Room.\" This captivating journey into a world where beauty and calm meet interactive mind training.", "short_description": "The game offers unique challenges that will help develop your attention and cognitive skills"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sbnrnWk2s9qw8Sfj50GatWuy6VDm4Pco31PHiqWqTQM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "UnsuiGo Oleksii Hinchuk", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61559711884734&sk=about", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7767022800016311"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "node